1. Method

Collected from books by various authors, retold in our own words; no text from
them is reproduced.


2. AI-tell pattern ideas (skills/writer/data/slop/*.json)

The original slop catalogs draw on the pattern ideas of the sources below.
Hints and examples are written for Writer; severity levels are our own.
The contextual observation catalogs extend those families. They are reading
aids, not claims of AI authorship or requirements to remove matched words.

